*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.dex
*.class
output.json

# Project documents. Local only, deliberately not published.
#
# These drive the build and are read every session, but they are working
# documents, not a public artefact. The repository root stays as code plus a
# README. Reasoning that is worth publishing goes in docs/adr/ once there is
# enough code for it to sit next to.
#
# WARNING: these are not backed up by git. Keep a copy somewhere else.
rules.md
prd.md
techspec.md
architecture.md
schema.md
design.md
appflow.md
implementationPlan.md
tracker.md
CLAUDE.md

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Logs and reports
*.log
**/build/reports/

# Roborazzi screenshot diffs. The recorded goldens are committed, the failure
# output is not.
**/build/outputs/roborazzi/
*_compare.png
*_actual.png
